  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a March 2026 reported statement, Chris Klomp said fee schedules tend to be inflationary and not tied to outcomes, and that he was averse to creating an AI-specific fee schedule. In a September 2026 official statement, Klomp said his center was not responsible for developing the WISeR model and offered to bring in more experts.",
